OL,3,AHong Kong's Tiananmen activists guilty
OL,4,Ain national security trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Hong Kong activists who organised
OL,7,Fannual vigils to commemorate the 1989
OL,8,FTiananmen Square crackdown have been
OL,9,Ffound guilty of inciting others to
OL,10,Fsubvert state power under the city's
OL,11,Fcontroversial national security law.
OL,13,FLee Cheuk-yan, 69, and Chow Hang-tung,
OL,14,F41, face a maximum penalty of 10 years
OL,15,Fin jail after being convicted under the
OL,16,FChina-introduced law. Sentencing is
OL,17,Fexpected at a later date.
OL,19,FA third defendant, Albert Ho, 74,
OL,20,Fpleaded guilty in January.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
